		"meta": {
			"author": "Stefan Mazur",
			"category": "effect",
			"deploymentTarget": {
				"branch": "",
				"name": "Wire",
				"version": {
					"major": 7,
					"minor": 29,
					"patch": 0
				}
			},
			"description": "Autumn Wind - an effect: 16 kinds of items drift through a real space in front of the viewer, over the clip below, with depth, gusts, tumble and eddies. Motion runs in real time. Scale sizes everything relative to the output height; wide surfaces get items across the whole width. Physics: Wind as strength + direction in the picture plane (where it goes: 0 = right, 90 = up) and Wind Direction Z into depth (0 = away from the viewer, 180 = towards the viewer, 90 = in the picture plane), Fall as strength + direction, Gust Sway (gust fronts travel through the items), Tumble (spin; flat items also flip and show a darker back), Speed Variation, Eddies (volumes of air carried by the wind; heavy items are whirled less; 0 = off), Eddy Size. Every kind has its own weight and size: feathers drift, bubbles rise, raindrops fall straight, planes and raindrops point along their path. Items: Performance Cap (upper limit of items in flight, for performance only; on very large surfaces it can limit the density), Item Size, Depth Spread (how deep the space is), Depth Haze (distant items fade), Vanishing Point X and Y (where depth converges: X from the centre, Y from the bottom edge, in output heights x Scale), Hue Variation (each item's hue turned by a fixed random amount up to this many degrees). Themes, each with Density and Color per item: Autumn (Leaf, Maple Seed, Oak Leaf, Twig, Feather), Street (Bowler, Cap, Paper Plane, Newspaper), Party (Confetti, Bubble, Heart, Note), Sky (Raindrop, Snowflake, Star, Star Twinkle). A Density is the number of items per reference area (output height x output height at Scale 1), so wider surfaces and smaller Scale values get more items; items in flight stay until they leave the space.",
			"displayName": "Autumn Wind",
			"identifier": "5c5509b5-6d07-4616-82b0-ba3475bcf9fe",
			"licenseName": "Unlicense",
			"mail": "S.Mazur@cati-co.de",
