					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "1024 slots = 16 types x 64. Per-slot random values (hash of Perlin), per-type tables: wind weight, fall weight, size, tumble, flip (only flat items flip), twinkle, align-to-motion. Velocity in the space = wind + fall + sway + eddy x wind weight, times speed variation. Colour: base colour of the type, hue turned per item by up to Hue Variation degrees."
					}
				},
