					},
					"font-size": {
						"type": "float",
						"value": 19
					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "Space: each item has a 3D position = start position + offset state. Viewer at the origin, picture plane at depth 2 (one picture height), perspective w = 2 \/ z, screen = vanishing point + lateral x w. Depth from 0.5 (near limit, items fade out between 1 and 0.5) to 2 \/ (1 - Depth Spread). Eddies are volumes with a random axis, carried by the wind. Items are drawn far to near (Sort + Read)."
					}
				},
